| **S3b** | 同上但 **vanilla 已 1.20–2.20×**，或 setattr/`.item()` | **fullgraph=False** + `compile_optimizer` | GPT2-cls +9.4%；**BERT_pytorch 42.6/31.3/27.9（+10.9%）** | BERT_pytorch `fullgraph=True` **−6.9%** |
